体育老师许杰意外绑定“最强班主任”系统，无奈接手全校闻名的“问题班级”：高二（9）班。他依托系统优势，秉持“因材施教”理念，逐一发掘出每个学生的潜藏天赋：足球妖孽楚潇然、游戏大神李浩、小说名家李虎、奥数奇才石云峰等。他打破应试教育束缚，为学生量身定制成长计划，让“学渣”们在擅长领域发光发热，狠狠打脸了质疑者。最终，这群曾被放弃的学生逆袭成长为各行业精英，而许杰也成为了改变他们命运的传奇班主任。","series_id":"7573648703974558744","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"202611062358040E9CD9EA4594AF924D7E\",\"rank\":\"4\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7573648703974558744\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"like\\\":0.08151976019144058,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.17377392947673798,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":1.1325953006744385,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.03085820935666561,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.1417791843414307,\\\"finish\\\":0.02442309446632862,\\\"collect\\\":0.0534033365547657}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7573648703974558744","play_cnt":225436,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"tomatotv","sub_title":"都市·逆袭翻身","score":"8.1","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":80,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5022,\"name\":\"都市\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5022&categoryName=都市&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5070,\"name\":\"逆袭翻身\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5070&categoryName=逆袭翻身&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5130,\"name\":\"系统\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5130&categoryName=系统&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5224,\"name\":\"大男主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5224&categoryName=大男主&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5338,\"name\":\"现代\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5338&categoryName=现代&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5315,\"name\":\"校园\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5315&categoryName=校园&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\"},{\"c